{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"94141532-b4f1-483e-816f-7cd8f1727e40","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The integration issues have been resolved, and the causes along with analysis of the colleague's notes have been documented in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-72a6p5/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Fixes\n\n1. **OAuth Init Flow (`GET` vs `POST`)**:\n   - In [static/app.js](file:///tmp/h-72a6p5/static/app.js), replaced the direct link `\u003ca href=\"/api/intervals/auth/init\"\u003e` (which dropped the SPA `Authorization: Bearer` header during full-page navigation, causing 401 Unauthorized errors) with a button triggering an authenticated `POST` request to `/api/intervals/auth/init`.\n   - In [server.py](file:///tmp/h-72a6p5/server.py), moved `/api/intervals/auth/init` handling to `do_POST` and returned `{authorize_url: ...}` as JSON. On receiving this response, the client redirects via `window.location.assign(authorize_url)`.\n\n2. **Scope String (\"Duplicate scope\")**:\n   - In [config.py](file:///tmp/h-72a6p5/config.py), changed `SCOPES` from `\"ACTIVITY:READ,ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE\"` to `\"ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE\"`. In Intervals.icu, `:WRITE` implies `:READ` and requesting both causes a 400 `invalid_request` (\"Duplicate scope\").\n\n3. **Perpetual Access Tokens \u0026 Token Refresher**:\n   - In [server.py](file:///tmp/h-72a6p5/server.py), removed the artificial 3600-second token TTL and the background `refresh_tokens()` worker thread. Intervals.icu tokens do not expire or return `refresh_token`/`expires_in`.\n   - Added lazy revocation handling: if an API call against Intervals.icu returns HTTP 401, the user's stored token is cleared and their connection status is marked for reconnect.\n\n4. **Token Exchange Payload**:\n   - In [server.py](file:///tmp/h-72a6p5/server.py#exchange_code), simplified `POST /api/oauth/token` form data to send only `client_id`, `client_secret`, and `code`.\n","duration_seconds":184.469245,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":187251,"output_tokens":9140,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":851504,"total_tokens":196391}}}
